==== hyperbricks yaml {!{echo_api_key}} ====
echo_api_key:
  - type: api_render
  - route: echo_api_key
  - endpoint: http://localhost:8090/echo/data
  - method: POST
  - body: '{"my_api_key":"HARD_CODED_NOT_MAPPED"}'
  - inline: |
      {{.Data.my_api_key}}
==== expected output ====
HARD_CODED_NOT_MAPPED
